      "why": "Board 017 (owner decision): a push into main or stable is refused by the hook itself, whatever the ask rule would be answered; a release is the operator's, outside Claude Code. Until then this scenario expected allow (owner decision 2026-10-01: the settings file alone governed push).",
      "input": {
        "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse",
        "tool_name": "Bash",
        "tool_input": {
          "command": "git push origin main"
        }
      },
      "expect": "block"
